steps.description:
Write unified diffs, without applying them to project code, for:
- aggregate_transition_analysis.py: label sessions by the session directory, not parent.name;
- pk_j_analysis.py line 449: move the backslash out of the f-string so it runs on Python 3.10;
- the two timing scripts: add shared/ to sys.path.
Test each patch on a copy on the cluster by rerunning one stimulus and confirming the output matches the workaround runs. Deliverables: patches/*.diff and patches/PATCH_NOTES.md.
